The app is reorganised. Matches open on Live, Summary or Info and show only tabs with something in them, with new Graphs and Squads tabs. Scorecards show who is yet to bat and each bowler's wides and no-balls, and players and teams can be tapped. Points tables sit inside the series. Alerts, follows and reminders share one screen. More is now the settings. Home has format and my-teams filters, and Upcoming and Recent are grouped by day.
